        {
          "en": "This game reminds the child of the order of the letters of the alphabet.",
          "zh": "这个游戏提醒这孩子的这条理的这信的这字母表。",
          "startMs": 44240,
          "endMs": 53486
        },
        {
          "en": "• Look through the book, noticing the letter beginning each animal name.",
          "zh": "• 看穿过这书， 布告这信开始每个动物名字。",
          "startMs": 53486,
          "endMs": 62732
        },
        {
          "en": "Think of an animal/bird/insect that starts with 'a'.",
          "zh": "想的一个动物/鸟/昆虫那个开始和……一起 '一个'。",
          "startMs": 62732,
          "endMs": 69410
        },
        {
          "en": "The child then thinks of one with 'b'.",
          "zh": "这孩子然后想的一和……一起 '第二'。",
          "startMs": 69410,
          "endMs": 74290
        },
        {
          "en": "Take turns through the alphabet.",
          "zh": "拿转动穿过这字母表。",
          "startMs": 74290,
          "endMs": 78400
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 78400,
          "endMs": 85719
        },
        {
          "en": "• Make up a quiz.",
          "zh": "• 做向上一个知识竞赛。",
          "startMs": 85719,
          "endMs": 87903
        },
        {
          "en": "Ask, \"Which animals were noisy?\"",
          "zh": "问， 哪个动物是喧闹的？",
